<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><oois xmlns="http://www.outdooractive.com/api/"><tour id="810804255" type="5250" frontendtype="tour" ranking="65.0" opened="false"><category id="1589846" name="Trails" iconUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconInactiveUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconMapUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconInactiveMapUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconTransparentUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/mountainbiking.geocontent.png" strokeColor="#ff0000" mapOverlays="mtb"><datatype>mountainbiking</datatype></category><title>SH 69 Wildenkaramba-Line</title><localizedTitle lang="en"><value>SH 69 Wildenkaramba-Line</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="fr"><value>SH 69 Wildenkaramba-Line</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="it"><value>SH 69 Wildenkaramba-Line</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="es"><value>SH 69 Línea Wildenkaramba</value></localizedTitle><shortText>&lt;b>Wildenkaramba-Line – Naturbelassen und abwechslungsreich&lt;/b>&#xd;
&lt;p>Die Wildenkaramba-Line ist ein naturbelassener Trail, der sich ruhig und unaufgeregt durch das Gelände zieht. Statt perfekt geshapeter Elemente stehen hier der ursprüngliche Untergrund und das natürliche Terrain im Mittelpunkt. Wurzeln, kleinere Steine und enge Kurven sorgen für eine abwechslungsreiche Linienwahl und ein authentisches Fahrgefühl.&lt;/p></shortText><longText>Der Streckenverlauf wechselt zwischen flüssigen Abschnitten und technischeren Passagen, die Konzentration und sauberes Fahren erfordern. Dabei bleibt der Trail stets gut lesbar und bietet erfahrenen Ridern ebenso wie fortgeschrittenen Bikern eine spannende, aber faire Herausforderung.&#xd;
&lt;p>Der Charakter: natürlich, technisch und bodenständig. Ein Trail für alle, die das Ursprüngliche schätzen und bewusstes Fahren im alpinen Gelände suchen.&lt;/p></longText><primaryImage id="628103466"><title>Biken in Saalbach</title><author>Moritz Ablinger</author></primaryImage><geometry>12.685878,47.400733,1902 12.685797,47.400728,1901 12.685603,47.400745,1898 12.685376,47.400782,1895 12.68515,47.400861,1897 12.684821,47.400927,1895 12.684516,47.401039,1893 12.684196,47.401201,1891 12.684073,47.401236,1890 12.683957,47.401271,1889 12.683873,47.401254,1886 12.683899,47.401188,1884 12.684077,47.401072,1887 12.684126,47.401045,1887 12.684136,47.401014,1886 12.684122,47.400997,1885 12.684088,47.400994,1884 12.683943,47.401039,1881 12.683909,47.401034,1880 12.683904,47.401007,1878 12.683975,47.400946,1878 12.684019,47.400899,1877 12.684024,47.400873,1876 12.683978,47.400862,1875 12.683883,47.400905,1873 12.683708,47.401043,1871 12.683618,47.401116,1870 12.683502,47.401159,1870 12.6834,47.401175,1869 12.683321,47.401185,1870 12.683198,47.401184,1870 12.683085,47.401175,1870 12.682967,47.401162,1870 12.682553,47.401109,1864 12.682154,47.401106,1861 12.681984,47.401151,1862 12.68189,47.401204,1861 12.681828,47.401276,1859 12.681786,47.401326,1857 12.681619,47.401448,1852 12.681442,47.401529,1850 12.681048,47.401637,1845 12.680472,47.401788,1841 12.679603,47.402081,1839 12.67924,47.402139,1838 12.678923,47.402155,1836 12.678473,47.40227,1833 12.678179,47.402361,1831 12.67791,47.402421,1827 12.67758,47.402434,1821 12.677276,47.402448,1819 12.677029,47.402448,1818 12.676822,47.402449,1817 12.67662,47.402464,1818 12.676547,47.402463,1817 12.676393,47.402461,1816 12.676319,47.402462,1815 12.676198,47.40247,1815 12.676064,47.402479,1815 12.675917,47.402504,1815 12.675802,47.402502,1815 12.67573,47.402492,1814 12.675574,47.402437,1812 12.675436,47.402407,1811 12.675077,47.402345,1805 12.674973,47.402301,1802 12.674891,47.402286,1801 12.674761,47.402286,1798 12.674674,47.4022